msgid "发行说明"
msgstr "Release Notes"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:3
msgid "本页记录 Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin 各版本的更新内容。"
msgstr "This page documents the updates for each version of Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:5
msgid "版本 0.3.0（2026-09-23）"
msgstr "Version 0.3.0 (2026-09-23)"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:7
msgid "新增"
msgstr "New Features"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:9
msgid "GBRBM 高斯-伯努利受限玻尔兹曼机；"
msgstr "Added GBRBM (Gaussian-Bernoulli Restricted Boltzmann Machine)."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:10
msgid "MAIFS 模型无关特征选择（`FeatureSelectionWrapper`）；"
msgstr "Added MAIFS (Model-Agnostic Feature Selection)."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:11
msgid "新增 Docker 开发环境。"
msgstr "Added a new Docker development environment."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:12
msgid "用量统计；"
msgstr "Added usage statistics tracking."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:14
msgid "改造"
msgstr "Refactoring"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:16
msgid "QVAE 重构为 `AutoEncoderBase` + config 驱动的工厂式构造；"
msgstr ""
"Refactored QVAE into an ``AutoEncoderBase`` + configuration-driven factory "
"architecture."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:17
msgid "QDiffusion 进行了接口调整，移除 `EnergyBackboneAdapter` Protocol；"
msgstr ""
"Updated the QDiffusion interface and removed the "
"``EnergyBackboneAdapter`` Protocol."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:18
msgid "dplm/qvae_mnist 示例由单体脚本拆分为 models/utils/workflows 分层结构。"
msgstr ""
"Refactored the dplm/qvae_mnist example from a monolithic script into a "
"layered structure with separate models, utils, and workflows modules."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:20
msgid "文档"
msgstr "Documentation"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:22
msgid "全量 rst 转 MyST Markdown，新增 10 篇理论基础、3 篇教程、贡献指南，数学渲染换 KaTeX。"
msgstr ""
"Migrated all documentation from reStructuredText (rst) to MyST Markdown. "
"Added 10 theoretical foundation documents, 3 tutorials, and a contribution "
"guide. Updated mathematical rendering to use KaTeX."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:24
msgid "版本 0.2.0（2026-07-07）"
msgstr "Version 0.2.0 (2026-07-07)"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:26
msgid "更新"
msgstr "Update"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:28
msgid ""
"**新增 `QDiffusion`** 在顶层插件接口中新增 `QDiffusion` 与 "
"`QDiffusionConfig`，使用基于玻尔兹曼机作为能量模型优化扩散过程。"
msgstr ""
"**``QDiffusion``** Added ``QDiffusion`` and ``QDiffusionConfig`` to the "
"top-level plugin API, using a Boltzmann machine as the energy model to "
"optimize the diffusion process."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:31
msgid "**新增 `QDiffusion` 蛋白质生成示例** 新增 `example/qdiffusion/` 示例目录，包括："
msgstr ""
"**``QDiffusion`` protein generation examples** Added a new "
"``example/qdiffusion/`` suite with:"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:33
msgid "`simple/`：用于快速理解 `QDiffusion` API 的最小训练与生成示例"
msgstr ""
"``simple/``: minimal training and generation scripts for learning the "
"``QDiffusion`` API"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:34
msgid "`dplm/`：基于 DPLM 的完整蛋白质序列生成工作流，涵盖模型构建、训练、引导生成、checkpoint 复现与评估"
msgstr ""
"``dplm/``: a full DPLM-based workflow for protein sequence generation, "
"including model construction, training, guided generation, checkpoint "
"rerun, and evaluation"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:36
msgid ""
"**新增 Q-VAE 单细胞表征学习示例** 新增 `example/qvae_cell/` "
"示例，提供单细胞表征学习完整流程，包括数据读取、Q-VAE 训练、潜在表示提取、可视化、能量分析以及下游 benchmark 评估。"
msgstr ""
"**Q-VAE single-cell representation learning example** Added a new "
"``example/qvae_cell/`` workflow for single-cell representation learning, "
"including data loading, Q-VAE training, latent embedding extraction, "
"visualization, energy analysis, and downstream benchmarking."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:39
msgid ""
"**新增 RISC-V 64 平台预编译 wheel** 提供 kaiwu 1.3.1 / kpp 0.2.0 在 RISC-V 64 "
"平台的预编译 wheel，安装方式见下文。"
msgstr ""
"**RISC-V 64 prebuilt wheels** Added prebuilt wheels for kaiwu 1.3.1 / kpp"
" 0.2.0 on RISC-V 64. See installation below."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:42
msgid "RISC-V 64 安装"
msgstr "RISC-V 64 Installation"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:44
msgid "要求：RISC-V 64 + Python 3.10 + glibc ≥ 2.31。"
msgstr "Requirements: RISC-V 64 + Python 3.10 + glibc ≥ 2.31."

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:59
msgid "验证："
msgstr "Verification:"

#: ../../source/about/release_notes.md:68
msgid "注：kaiwu / kpp 因 PyPI 上 riscv64 依赖不全，需 `--no-deps`；numpy 须先于 pandas。"
msgstr ""
"Note: kaiwu / kpp must be installed with ``--no-deps`` because the "
"riscv64 dependencies on PyPI are incomplete; numpy must be installed "
"before pandas."

